{"id":"n15929-1-7","stage":3,"title":"매장 · 卖场","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15929-1-7-1","ko":"옆집 누나가 옷가게를 하는데 매장을 빌리는 값이 만만치 않대.","zh":"隔壁的姐姐开了一家服装店，不过据说租店子的费用可不便宜。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옆집","meaning":"邻居，隔壁","explanation":"옆집：邻居，隔壁。","readings":[{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71723","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}},{"text":"누나가","meaning":"姐姐（男性对年长女性的亲切称呼）","explanation":"누나：姐姐（男性对年长女性的亲切称呼）；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누나","audio":"/audio/6f46257ffa57c2f085e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32205","senseId":"2","lemma":"누나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누나가","audio":"/audio/cf52d1052fe0bc3afd06.mp3"}},{"text":"옷가게를","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装；店，店铺，商店","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；가게：店，店铺，商店；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"},{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷가게를","audio":"/audio/dbcf350ec120ac56b394.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데","audio":"/audio/f78512dad8d31fc58a77.mp3"}},{"text":"매장을","meaning":"卖场，商场","explanation":"매장：卖场，商场；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"매장","audio":"/audio/c396dd563fe12c6bb9e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15929","senseId":"1","lemma":"매장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매장을","audio":"/audio/d50201fdd190b54f5c8e.mp3"}},{"text":"빌리는","meaning":"借","explanation":"빌리다：借；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌리는","audio":"/audio/8fb4453aeb1b97f7d3ac.mp3"}},{"text":"값이","meaning":"价","explanation":"값：价；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"값","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20178","senseId":"8","lemma":"값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"값이","audio":"/audio/646f3fb5806a654c4eb5.mp3"}},{"text":"만만치","meaning":"好对付，轻松","explanation":"만만하다：好对付，轻松；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"만만하다","audio":"/audio/9275a1b31177f1471f51.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15807","senseId":"1","lemma":"만만하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만만치","audio":"/audio/b54945c424a1fe42b145.mp3"}},{"text":"않대.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않대","audio":"/audio/20aa72e497180508f28f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d4901559765ba929","term":"옆집","zh":"邻居，隔壁","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3","entryId":"71723","definition":"旁边的一家。","pronunciation":["엽찝"]},{"id":"6f46257ffa57c2f0","term":"누나","zh":"姐姐（男性对年长女性的亲切称呼）","audio":"/audio/6f46257ffa57c2f085e4.mp3","entryId":"32205","definition":"男子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["누ː나"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"c396dd563fe12c6b","term":"매장","zh":"卖场，商场","audio":"/audio/c396dd563fe12c6bb9e6.mp3","entryId":"15929","definition":"出售东西的场所。","pronunciation":["매ː장"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"b19ddf94b4c9896b","term":"값","zh":"价","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3","entryId":"20178","definition":"表示价格、货款、费用等。","pronunciation":["갑"]},{"id":"9275a1b31177f147","term":"만만하다","zh":"好对付，轻松","audio":"/audio/9275a1b31177f1471f51.mp3","entryId":"15807","definition":"对待或处理上没有困难，比较容易。","pronunciation":["만만하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/8a4308b5fcb1707f805f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15929-1-7-2","ko":"저런. 장사는 좀 된대?","zh":"哎呀，那家店的生意怎么样啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저런.","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"저런：啊，哎呀。","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71224","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}},{"text":"장사는","meaning":"生意，经商","explanation":"장사：生意，经商；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"장사","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71699","senseId":"1","lemma":"장사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장사는","audio":"/audio/381260372d1b425d00d5.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"ter